WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:07.000
What's up everybody!

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.140
We are Pongfinity

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:09.860
Today we will be doing tennis trick shots.

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:11.920
With us here we have got the Finnish tennis pro

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:13.060
Otto Virtanen

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:15.100
Thank you for having me!

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:17.540
Let's do some fun tricks!

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:57.880
Alright, let's see how well the Pongfinity guys can return my serves.

00:00:58.260 --> 00:00:59.380
First serve now!

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:00.320
I'm ready!

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:07.300
What!?

00:01:13.820 --> 00:01:14.900
No chance

00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:26.720
I wonder if you can do a cartwheel shot in tennis?

00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:53.300
I got a point!

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:55.640
Let's go upstairs!

00:02:08.740 --> 00:02:09.960
The upstairs winner!

00:02:10.780 --> 00:02:13.580
Okay, I'm pretty confident that I will do a bit better than Emil.

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:17.440
Nice one!

00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:18.280
One!

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:21.860
I touched it!

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:23.400
Not an ace!

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:30.320
Okay, that was difficult.

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:38.860
What was that?

00:02:39.020 --> 00:02:42.320
Okay, let's see if a side change is possible in tennis.

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:44.360
In this case, the rules don't matter!

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:04.380
Nice!

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:06.700
I'm going to smash the ball!

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:11.380
Out.

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:13.880
Out.

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:21.020
It was a good try!

00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:27.740
I'm not going to run for that.

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:41.620
Let's see if Otto can do the double.

00:03:57.480 --> 00:03:59.980
Now let's see how well Otto can receive my serve.

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:08.420
No... he didn't really seem to have any trouble with that one!

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:10.960
Alright, thanks for coming over Otto!

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:12.740
We wish you the best of luck for Wimbledon!

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:15.260
Thank you! I hope to use some tricks also there!

00:04:15.740 --> 00:04:17.040
Remember to hit subscribe

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:18.840
Watch our previous videos there.

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:20.560
Until next time!

